name issue_466_scene_change_1mbps
describe 1 Mbps link, a scene cut every 5 s: 5 delta frames at 3x
duration 40s
scene_change 5s 5 3
at 0s capacity=1mbps delay=30ms queue=300ms
# Issue #466 (see issue_466_overshoot_1mbps.scn). Without cuts the queue p95 is
# 34-46 ms and the video e2e p95 103-129 ms (seeds 1-3); with them 77-104 ms
# and 338-363 ms, and the adjuster's target is 740-750 kbps instead of 788-800.
expect cc.queue_p95_ms > 60
expect video.e2e_delay_p95_ms > 250
expect video.encoder_target_avg_kbps < 780
